<title>SOUTH KOREA: TABLE-LG Construction H1 net rises.</title>
<headline>TABLE-LG Construction H1 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1997-08-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30</p>
<p>	 (in billion won unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (won)				     634 vs 554</p>
<p>    Net					   10.34 vs 9.03</p>
<p>    Profit before tax			 14.87 vs 13.24</p>
<p>    Turnover				   978.57 vs 832.24</p>
<p>Note - LG Construction Co Ltd, a unit of the LG Group, is one of South Korea's leading construction companies. The figures were released by the Korea Listed Companies Association.</p>
<p>-- Seoul Newsroom (822) 727 5645</p>
</text>
